1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:10,480
On the Instruments tab you can add any instrument to your own watchlists.

2
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:14,700
Find the instrument and click it to open its details.

3
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,620
Click Add to Watchlist.

4
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:22,560
Tick the lists it should go in, then click Done.

5
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:31,770
The star shows it is in one of your lists.

6
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:40,500
On the Trading tab, it now appears in that watchlist.

7
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,670
Press Alt+W to show or hide the news panel.

8
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:50,890
Market News shows the latest stories as they come in.

9
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:55,050
The details panel also lists news about the selected instrument.

10
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:59,150
Press Alt+W again to hide the news panel.

